s://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-03-05T12:17:14Z","updated_at":"2026-03-09T14:11:40Z","closed_at":"2026-03-09T10:53:25Z","assignee":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.6.1.stable.official [14d19694e], v4.7.dev2.official [778cf54da]\n- Not reproducible in: v4.5.stable.official [876b29033]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - CachyOS Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sat, 28 Feb 2026 14:31:21 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 SUPER (nvidia; 590.48.01) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-9700K CPU @ 3.60GHz (8 threads) - 31.13 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen calling `is_valid_filename()` on a `String` or even `StringName` node property I get a crash when running a *release build on Linux*. There is no crash when running a debug build. Also there was no crash when running a Windows release build via wine.\n\nThe crash ends with a message `Segmentation fault (core dumped)` when running in a bash shell or `terminated by signal SIGSEGV (Address boundary error)` when running in a fish shell.\n\nExample of a crashing code:\n```gdscript\nvar x: String = $LineEdit.text\nassert(x == \"\")\nx.is_valid_filename()  # Crashes here\n```\nThe following code doesn't crash:\n```gdscript\nvar x: String = $LineEdit.text\nassert(x == \"\")\nx = \"\"  # Added line, is assert lying?\nx.is_valid_filename()\n```\nShort version that also crashes:\n```gdscript\nLineEdit.new().text.is_valid_filename()\n```\n\nSimilar thing happens with `StringName` properties such as `AnimationPlayer.current_animation`.\n\nThe culprit behind `String.is_valid_filename()` crashing seems to be https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104280 ~but `StringName.is_valid_filename()` is also crashing so more investigation is needed.~\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the MRP project\n2. Export the project with Linux preset (Make sure to uncheck \"Export With Debug\" to make a release build)\n3. Run the resulting binary\n\nScript version:\n```\ngodot --headless --export-release Linux\n./bin/segfault.x86_64\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[segfault.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25767107/segfault.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117103/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117103/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}